# Lyra's trigger counts Angels as it resolves (CR 608.2c). Bot1 has Youthful Valkyrie and then casts Lyra: Lyra entering gives the
# Valkyrie a counter (another Angel entered, 2/4). Bot1's Lightning Helix gains life, Lyra's ability goes on the stack, and
# Bot2 Bolts Lyra in response, killing her (3/3). The ability still resolves: the Valkyrie, the only Angel left, gets a second
# counter (3/5); Lyra, gone, gets none. (Bot2 passes on the Helix first so that Lyra is alive for the life gain.)

